  "title": "Chef Neal&#39;s Strawberry-Rhubarb Sour Cream Pies",
  "description": "Chef Neal&#39;s strawberry-rhubarb sour cream pie recipe uses sour cream as the secret ingredient for an extra-rich filling and yields two 9-inch pies.",
